# Pin test fixture bytes so they are byte-identical on every platform and every
# core.autocrlf setting.  Fixtures encode line endings as part of the test
# contract (e.g. tests/fixtures/legacy_codedoc_14.md is read via raw bytes), so
# any newline conversion on checkin/checkout would make the suite platform
# dependent.  -text disables all EOL conversion for the fixture tree only; it is
# deliberately not applied repo-wide, which would renormalize the whole tree.
tests/fixtures/** -text
